    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4827" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλωπεκ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mongrel between fox and dog,</i>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυναλώπηξ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				3.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fox-skin cap,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.4.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> kind of
				<i>grape,</i> so-called from its colour, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				14.42
			</span></i>.</div>
